 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hi, doctor. This is Oscar, he's seven. His eczema's flared, and I'm worried about the steroid cream, I've read it thins the skin, and I'm not sure we should keep using it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Understandable. Oscar, where's the itchiest bit?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Elbows. And behind the knees."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is your skin dry?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it keep you awake?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He scratches in his sleep, he wakes up crying."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weeping or crusting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, nothing wet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you using?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hydrocortisone cream, once a day, on the red bits. And cetirizine syrup."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have 5 ml."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's 10 ml, Oscar. I measure it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll check the label. Oscar, any allergies? Anything you can't eat?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm not allergic to anything."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Well, the egg, last year, he came up in hives, I'm not sure it was an allergy though."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll record both. Any other history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Just the eczema, since a baby."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And school?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Year two."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Swimming?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Lessons on Saturday. The chlorine stings him."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check him. Temperature 36.7, pulse 90, breathing 20, oxygen 99 percent, weight 24 kilos, height 120 centimetres.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "All fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All good. Oscar, show me your elbows.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Here. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Dry, red, scaly patches in both elbow creases and behind the knees."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's what I see. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And some scratch marks, but no sign of crusting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any wheeze or cough?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This looks like an eczema flare, but I can't rule out a skin infection on top, so I'd like to arrange a skin swab."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is the steroid cream safe? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Used the way I describe, yes. Short bursts on red areas only, thinning happens with long, heavy use."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's reassuring. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Moisturise generously, several times a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Will do. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
